---
description: Temporal competitor monitoring — snapshots, deltas, events. Not one-time teardown or static dossier only.
alwaysApply: false
---

When the user asks to **monitor competitors over time**, detect **what changed** since last
scan, maintain watchlist/digest, or verify competitor claims with evidence — load
`competitive-intelligence`.

Separate Observation → State → Delta → Implication. Run `scripts/ci_kernel.py` for
snapshot validation, diff, and scoring.

For external **pattern extraction** to implement (`product-teardown`) or one-off deep profile
without temporal ops, route elsewhere.
